==Elfdalian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|dlc}} {{term|einn|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|dlc}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*ainaz}}. Cognate with Swedish {{term|en|lang=sv}}.

===Article===
{{head|dlc|article|g=m}}

# [[a]], [[an]]

===Numeral===
{{head|dlc|numeral|g=m}}

# [[one]]

====Usage notes====
The masculine and feminine forms are used only together with a following noun. When used alone (such as when counting), the neuter form {{term|iett|lang=dlc}} is used instead.

